.TH FATHOM_MCP 1  "fathom 0.1.0-alpha.1" 
.SH NAME
fathom\-mcp \- Speak MCP to a coding agent
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfathom mcp\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Speak MCP to a coding agent
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
fathom\-mcp\-serve(1)
Serve the tool surface over stdio, which opens no socket (`e6.4`)
.TP
fathom\-mcp\-tools(1)
Print the tool surface and its bounds as this repository\*(Aqs config resolves them
.TP
fathom\-mcp\-approval\-token(1)
Mint the token that authorises `mark_reviewed` for exactly one change
